          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho yongera kubarira Gideyoni, ati N’ubu abantu baracari benshi kurenza urugero; bamanukane ku mazi, nanje ndabagusuzumire; maz’ uwo nja kukubarira kw ari we mujana, abe ari we mujana nyene; arik’ uwo nja kukubarira, nti Ntimujane, uwo we ntagende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw amanukana abo bantu ku mazi, maz’ Uhoraho abarira Gideyoni, at’ Umuntu wese aja gusabagira amazi n’ ururimi nk’imbga, umushire ukwiwe; kandi n’ūja gupfukama mu kunywa na we umushire ukwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igitigiri c’abānyoye basabagiye ku mashi yabo car’ amajana atatu; arikw abandi bose bārapfukamye mu kunywa amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho abarira Gideyoni, at’ Abo bantu amajana atatu banyoye basabagira ni bo nzobakirisha, ngabure Abamidiyani mu maboko yawe; abandi bose ni bītahire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abo amajana atatu bāka abo bandi impamba zabo n’inzamba zabo. Maze Gideyoni arungika abo Bisirayeli bose bacaguwe, umuntu wese asubira i we, asigarana n’abo amajana atatu. Kand’ Abamidiyani bari bashagaje mu kiyaya hepfo yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
