          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Gideyoni ashitseyo, yumva umuntu arotorera inzozi mugenzi we, ati Ndose inzozi, mbona irobe ry’umutsima wa sayiri ritembagara, rishika mu nsago z’Abamidiyani, ryikubita kw ihema, iryo hema rirubama, rirambarara hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugenzi we aramwishura, ati Nta kindi, iyo n’inkota ya Gideyoni mwene Yowasi, w’Umwisirayeli. Imana yagabuye Abamidiyani n’ingabo zabo zose mu maboko yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
